Elder Guardian: Look at you! The light has returned to your eyes. The Lanterns have helped you find your strength again. I'm proud of how far you've come.
-> I couldn't have done it alone
    <<jump community_strength>>
-> I'm ready to face her again
    <<jump rematch_discussion>>
-> The hub feels alive again
    <<jump hub_restored>>
-> Thank you for believing in me
    <<jump always_believed>>
===
title: community_strength
---
Elder Guardian: And that's the lesson the Veil Maiden never learned. True strength comes from connection, not isolation. You've rebuilt what she tried to destroy.
-> The Lanterns saved me
    <<jump lanterns_impact>>
-> I want to help others now
    <<jump pay_it_forward>>
-> What's next for me?
    <<jump final_preparation>>
