title: rematch_discussion
---
Elder Guardian: Your resolve is clear, but remember - this battle isn't just about defeating her. It's about proving that light can endure even after darkness.
-> What do you mean?
    <<jump battle_meaning>>
-> I'm stronger than before
    <<jump acknowledge_growth>>
-> Will I be ready?
    <<jump ready_assessment>>
