title: hub_restored
---
Elder Guardian: It does, doesn't it? The NPCs have returned, the portals glow brightly once more. The hub reflects your inner state - and you're healing beautifully.
-> It feels like home again
    <<jump home_reflection>>
-> But Yin and Yang are still gone
    <<jump bittersweet_reality>>
-> I'm ready for what comes next
    <<jump final_preparation>>
