title: always_believed
---
Elder Guardian: Even in the darkest moments, I saw the spark within you. You just needed time to find it again. And you did.
-> What happens now?
    <<jump final_preparation>>
-> I'm grateful for your support
    <<stop>>
===
title: lanterns_impact
---
Elder Guardian: They reminded you that you're not alone, that others have walked this path. That's the power of shared experience - it breaks the isolation.
-> I want to be a Lantern for others
    <<jump pay_it_forward>>
-> Their stories gave me hope
    <<jump hope_restored>>
===
title: pay_it_forward
---
Elder Guardian: And you will be. Your journey - from loss to recovery - will inspire others who face the Hollow Depths. You're proof that healing is possible.
-> First, I need to stop the Veil Maiden
    <<jump final_preparation>>
-> That gives my suffering meaning
    <<jump meaning_in_pain>>
===
title: battle_meaning
---
Elder Guardian: The Veil Maiden is hollow herself - broken, manipulative, feeding on others' light. When you face her, you'll have a choice to make.
-> What choice?
    <<jump moral_choice_hint>>
-> I'll destroy her for what she did
    <<jump vengeance_path>>
-> Can she be saved?
    <<jump redemption_path>>
===
title: acknowledge_growth
---
Elder Guardian: You are. Not just in power, but in wisdom. You understand now that strength isn't about never falling - it's about rising again.
-> I won't fall again
    <<jump confidence_response>>
-> What should I prepare for?
    <<jump final_preparation>>
===
title: ready_assessment
---
Elder Guardian: You're ready now. You've regained your abilities, strengthened your resolve, and most importantly - you're not fighting alone anymore.
-> The Lanterns will support me?
    <<jump support_network>>
-> Then let's finish this
    <<jump final_preparation>>
===
title: home_reflection
---
Elder Guardian: Home isn't just a place - it's the people, the connections, the sense of belonging. You've rebuilt all of that. The hub is whole because you are.
-> I understand now
    <<jump wisdom_gained>>
-> What's the final step?
    <<jump final_preparation>>
===
title: bittersweet_reality
---
Elder Guardian: Yes. And that pain will always be part of you. But pain doesn't erase joy, and loss doesn't erase love. They coexist, as light and shadow do.
-> I'll carry them with me
    <<jump carrying_memory>>
-> Is there any way to honor them?
    <<jump honor_memory>>
-> I'm ready to move forward
    <<jump final_preparation>>
===
title: hope_restored
---
Elder Guardian: Hope is the antidote to hollowness. You found it again, not through denial of your pain, but through connection despite it.
-> I want to face the Veil Maiden
    <<jump final_preparation>>
-> Thank you, Elder
    <<stop>>
===
title: meaning_in_pain
---
Elder Guardian: Not all suffering has meaning, but you've chosen to give yours purpose. That's the mark of a true guardian.
-> I'm ready for the final battle
    <<jump final_preparation>>
-> Your words mean a lot
    <<stop>>
