title: moral_choice_hint
---
Elder Guardian: When you defeat her - and you will - you'll decide her fate. Destroy the threat forever, or offer her the redemption no one gave her. Neither choice is wrong.
-> How will I know what to choose?
    <<jump trust_yourself>>
-> She doesn't deserve redemption
    <<jump vengeance_understanding>>
-> Everyone deserves a second chance
    <<jump mercy_understanding>>
