title: vengeance_path
---
Elder Guardian: Your anger is justified. She took everything from you. But remember - acting from rage makes you more like her. Act from strength instead.
-> I'll be mindful of that
    <<jump final_preparation>>
-> Justice isn't the same as rage
    <<jump justice_distinction>>
===
title: redemption_path
---
Elder Guardian: Perhaps. She's broken, hollow, feeding on others because she has nothing within. Saving her won't bring Yin and Yang back, but it may break the cycle.
-> I'll decide when the time comes
    <<jump trust_yourself>>
-> Breaking the cycle matters
    <<jump cycle_breaker>>
===
title: confidence_response
---
Elder Guardian: Confidence is good, but remember - falling isn't failure. What matters is that you know how to rise, and who will help you when you do.
-> You're right
    <<jump final_preparation>>
-> I won't forget the Lanterns
    <<stop>>
