title: support_network
---
Elder Guardian: Not in battle - this is your fight. But they'll be here when you return, regardless of the outcome. You'll never face emptiness alone again.
-> That's all I need
    <<stop>>
-> Then I'm ready
    <<jump final_preparation>>
